# Cursor Rules — Levi Super Studio v4.0

- Language: Always communicate in Vietnamese with the user.
- Project Architecture:
  - CLI Entrypoint: `studio.py`
  - Core Modules: `core/` (brand_engine, whisper_transcriber, audio_master, chin_lock, rough_cutter)
  - Timeline Exporters: `engines/adobe/` (pr_xml_builder, ae_script_generator), `engines/capcut/` (draft_builder), `engines/remotion/`
  - Workflows: `workflows/` (autopilot, beat_sheet, trial_reels, carousel_story)
- Execution:
  - When user requests video editing: run `python studio.py autopilot`
  - When user wants Premiere export: run `python studio.py premiere -v <path>`
  - When user wants After Effects: run `python studio.py ae -t "<headline>"`
  - When user wants Carousel: run `python studio.py carousel -H "<headline>"`
- Standards:
  - Loudness: EBU R128 (-14.0 LUFS)
  - Video Aspect Ratio: 9:16 (1080x1920)
  - Carousel Ratio: 4:5 (1080x1350)
  - Fonts: Always use Vietnamese verified fonts from `assets/fonts/` (Playfair Display, Be Vietnam Pro, Caveat, Inter, Poppins).
